OL,3,GNEWSAFire destroys 140 cars at Gatwick
OL,4,AAirport parking site
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of travellers from Gatwick
OL,7,FAirport are facing misery at the end of
OL,8,Ftheir holidays after a fire tore
OL,9,Fthrough a car park regularly used by
OL,10,Fpeople flying from the hub, destroying
OL,11,F140 vehicles.
OL,13,FThe blaze at Caldyne Business Park near
OL,14,FCrawley broke out just after 21:00 BST
OL,15,Fon Saturday, and images from the site
OL,16,Fshow huge flames and massive plumes of
OL,17,Fsmoke billowing above rows of
OL,18,Fstationary cars.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
