OL,3,GNEWSAFire destroys 140 cars at Gatwick
OL,4,AAirport parking site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 67-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson, and has been bailed
OL,8,Fpending further inquiries, Sussex
OL,9,FPolice said.
OL,11,FMore than 2,000 homes were also left
OL,12,Fwithout power on Saturday due to the
OL,13,Fblaze, but electricity has since been
OL,14,Frestored to those affected.
